$L_{U',49}$ for some pentagonal face $U'$.  The centre vertex of $U$ will
be denoted by $o$, and for $i \in \{1,\ldots,11\}$,
the centre vertex of $U_i$ will be denoted by $o_i$. 
Given a pentagonal face $U$, we will often abuse notation
and write $U$ to denote the subgraph of $\cD$ that is embedded on the face $U$.
