+use exactly {n} low bits.  Let gray(z)=z XOR floor(z/2).  To obtain the branch
+label B(i), start with gray(({inst['order_offset']} +
+{inst['order_direction']}*i) mod {m}); move source bit j to output bit p[j]
+for
