The module is implemented and compiling. Its expensive self-test is now running the honest Track B baseline rather than shortcutting it: eight full endpoint scans at the 24-bit shipping preset, plus 200,000 structure-aware guesses. This is also the measurement that will replace the provisional hardness wording with concrete wall-clock and operation counts.
